WEBVTT

00:33.241 --> 00:37.954
‎AGENT KIM REACTIVATED

00:39.956 --> 00:40.999
‎CHEONSAN UNIT, GANGWON PROVINCE

00:41.082 --> 00:43.418
‎Two of our covert operatives
‎and a diplomat

00:43.501 --> 00:48.173
‎were killed in succession
‎in Singapore, Hong Kong, and Japan.

00:48.256 --> 00:51.593
‎All were operatives secretly setting up
‎the inter-Korean peace talks.

00:52.385 --> 00:53.678
‎The one behind the assassinations

00:53.762 --> 00:55.513
‎was hard-liner
‎Deputy Director Kim Jeong Seon

00:55.597 --> 00:57.724
‎of the General Bureau of Intelligence
‎on South Korea.

00:57.807 --> 00:58.850
‎Eliminate him.

01:00.226 --> 01:03.188
‎Show him the brutal price

01:03.980 --> 01:05.106
‎of crossing us.

02:07.544 --> 02:08.503
‎Get out.

02:12.132 --> 02:13.174
‎In the passenger seat.

02:49.294 --> 02:51.880
‎This is where you and I will both die.

02:53.590 --> 02:54.674
‎-What the hell?
‎-Hey!

02:54.757 --> 02:56.509
‎Korea People's TV reported this morning

02:56.593 --> 02:59.679
‎that an impulsive act
‎by a North Korean People's Army officer

02:59.762 --> 03:02.974
‎killed hard-liner
‎Deputy Director Kim Jeong Seon

03:03.057 --> 03:05.518
‎of the General Bureau of Intelligence
‎on South Korea.

03:05.602 --> 03:07.562
‎A so-called military officer

03:07.645 --> 03:11.900
‎conspired with hostile forces to target
‎our nation's veteran revolutionary,

03:11.983 --> 03:14.193
‎Deputy Director Comrade Kim Jeong Seon…

03:14.277 --> 03:17.196
‎The identity of the North Korean officer
‎remains unknown,

03:17.280 --> 03:19.032
‎and they are reported
‎to have died together.

03:19.824 --> 03:23.077
‎-Last year, Deputy Director Kim…
‎-Well, well.

03:23.745 --> 03:25.788
‎I guess he really wanted to
‎get discharged.

03:25.872 --> 03:28.207
‎…he was also the driving force
‎behind the systemization.

03:28.291 --> 03:30.585
‎OB-GYN SURGERY CENTER

03:30.668 --> 03:33.296
‎EPISODE 2

03:33.379 --> 03:35.423
‎Excuse me, I'm Im Yu-jin's husband.

03:35.506 --> 03:36.549
‎Just a moment, please.

03:37.634 --> 03:38.885
‎She's in labor right now.

03:39.802 --> 03:40.678
‎It's that way.

03:45.099 --> 03:45.934
‎OB-GYN OPERATING ROOM

03:46.017 --> 03:47.602
‎You have to keep breathing.

03:47.685 --> 03:49.520
‎-You're doing well. Breathe!
‎-Good.

03:49.604 --> 03:52.065
‎I know you're tired, but keep breathing.

03:52.732 --> 03:54.692
‎You're almost there.

03:58.154 --> 03:59.697
‎I'm here for Im Yu-jin.

03:59.781 --> 04:01.491
‎She's in surgery right now.

04:04.244 --> 04:06.496
‎-Doctor.
‎-The baby is healthy.

04:09.082 --> 04:11.292
‎But the mother…

04:43.866 --> 04:44.742
‎Yu-jin.

04:48.579 --> 04:49.956
‎Let's name our child…

04:51.374 --> 04:52.917
‎Min-ji.

04:57.463 --> 05:00.091
‎Forget everything,

05:01.259 --> 05:05.680
‎leave the past behind…

05:09.559 --> 05:12.103
‎and live as Min-ji's dad.

05:15.940 --> 05:17.358
‎Raise our Min-ji…

05:19.402 --> 05:22.113
‎to be someone who can be loved…

05:23.614 --> 05:27.118
‎and someone who can give love.

05:28.661 --> 05:30.413
‎Like any father in this world…

05:32.290 --> 05:33.750
‎who would do anything

05:34.625 --> 05:37.337
‎for his daughter…

05:41.549 --> 05:42.842
‎I want you

05:44.218 --> 05:45.511
‎to live

05:46.804 --> 05:48.514
‎as the father of our daughter…

05:50.767 --> 05:51.934
‎Min-ji.

06:11.329 --> 06:12.580
‎Let me go!

06:13.331 --> 06:14.248
‎Sergeant Kim.

06:14.957 --> 06:15.917
‎Put down the gun.

06:16.501 --> 06:18.669
‎You're only making things worse!

06:19.670 --> 06:20.755
‎Let me go.

06:21.714 --> 06:23.424
‎Discharge me right now!

06:23.508 --> 06:24.759
‎We'll pretend this never happened.

06:25.551 --> 06:27.053
‎So calm down, okay?

06:32.266 --> 06:33.851
‎You promised me my freedom

06:34.811 --> 06:36.896
‎if I completed this mission.

06:38.189 --> 06:40.066
‎You said that the last two times.

06:45.321 --> 06:46.280
‎I've done everything

06:47.657 --> 06:50.201
‎you people told me to do up until now…

06:53.704 --> 06:55.331
‎just to survive.

06:56.207 --> 06:58.417
‎If you go back on your word again…

07:01.796 --> 07:03.714
‎I'm prepared to wipe out this unit

07:04.298 --> 07:05.883
‎and take you all down with me.

07:05.967 --> 07:08.136
‎Okay, okay.

07:08.219 --> 07:09.220
‎I'll grant your discharge.

07:10.179 --> 07:12.348
‎That's not a problem.

07:12.974 --> 07:15.184
‎So just calm down, okay?

07:16.060 --> 07:16.936
‎Calm down.

07:19.397 --> 07:21.315
‎FORMULA FEEDING METHOD AND CARE

07:29.532 --> 07:30.491
‎There, there.

07:34.454 --> 07:35.371
‎Let me rest a bit.

07:35.455 --> 07:39.834
‎Leave the past behind…

07:40.793 --> 07:41.627
‎Hold on.

07:44.255 --> 07:45.381
‎Hey, Han-soo.

07:45.465 --> 07:47.300
‎Min-ji has a fever.

07:47.383 --> 07:48.384
‎Let's see here.

07:48.468 --> 07:49.343
‎Gosh, that stinks.

07:49.427 --> 07:50.386
‎Daddy.

07:50.970 --> 07:53.181
‎And live as Min-ji's dad.

07:53.264 --> 07:54.432
‎Daddy!

07:56.058 --> 07:56.893
‎Daddy?

07:58.686 --> 07:59.520
‎Daddy?

08:02.773 --> 08:04.275
‎Raise our Min-ji

08:04.358 --> 08:07.195
‎to be someone who can be loved…

08:08.029 --> 08:13.701
‎He straightens his crooked tie

08:13.784 --> 08:18.456
‎And even through the endless, tiring days

08:18.539 --> 08:22.335
‎He finds his strength and walks on

08:22.960 --> 08:25.505
‎Nothing can stop him

08:25.588 --> 08:27.465
‎My dad is the best

08:27.548 --> 08:31.260
‎-…and someone who can give love.
‎-Daddy!

08:31.344 --> 08:32.845
‎Daddy!

08:34.388 --> 08:35.348
‎Min-ji!

08:35.431 --> 08:37.475
‎Like any father in this world…

08:39.060 --> 08:40.937
‎who would do anything

08:42.230 --> 08:45.983
‎-for his daughter…
‎-One, two, three!

08:46.067 --> 08:48.361
‎-Thank you!
‎-Thank you!

08:48.444 --> 08:49.904
‎Take a photo with me, Dad.

08:49.987 --> 08:51.822
‎Come on, hurry!

08:51.906 --> 08:52.823
‎Sorry!

08:53.699 --> 08:54.909
‎I want you

08:55.785 --> 08:56.994
‎to live…

08:57.078 --> 08:59.372
‎MYEONGEUN ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
‎28TH GRADUATION CEREMONY

09:02.875 --> 09:04.335
‎Dad!

09:06.712 --> 09:08.464
‎…as the father of our daughter,

09:09.382 --> 09:10.508
‎Min-ji.

09:13.261 --> 09:14.595
‎Dad…

09:21.060 --> 09:22.937
‎AGENT KIM REACTIVATED

09:23.896 --> 09:27.358
‎LAST NIGHT

09:31.487 --> 09:32.321
‎That's him.

09:35.491 --> 09:37.702
‎Hey, are you Kim Nam-hoon?

09:39.579 --> 09:40.788
‎Who are you?

09:40.871 --> 09:43.249
‎That's none of your business. Come here.

09:43.332 --> 09:45.084
‎Let's go over there and have a chat.

09:51.632 --> 09:54.385
‎Go easy on him, man.

09:55.678 --> 09:57.471
‎Min-ji, Min-ji.

09:58.014 --> 10:00.808
‎"I have something to tell you."

10:01.475 --> 10:04.520
‎"I'll be at the back gate at school."

10:04.604 --> 10:07.398
‎"I'll wait until you get here."

10:15.531 --> 10:17.033
‎I have something to tell you.

10:17.116 --> 10:18.367
‎I'll be at the back gate at school.

10:19.201 --> 10:20.411
‎I'll wait until you get here.

10:24.915 --> 10:29.420
‎NO UNAUTHORIZED ENTRY

10:36.636 --> 10:37.928
‎-Kim Min-ji!
‎-Hey!

10:38.012 --> 10:39.722
‎Min-ji!

10:39.805 --> 10:41.390
‎You really came.

10:42.141 --> 10:44.352
‎-She actually came.
‎-I can't believe you showed up.

10:46.020 --> 10:48.230
‎-Min-ji, Min-ji!
‎-Hey, Min-ji.

10:48.314 --> 10:50.274
‎She actually showed up.

10:52.068 --> 10:53.444
‎I have bad news.

10:54.528 --> 10:56.572
‎Nam-hoon isn't feeling well,

10:57.448 --> 10:59.116
‎so he can't come.

11:00.284 --> 11:02.036
‎-Oh no.
‎-You okay?

11:02.662 --> 11:05.623
‎Don't worry. We're here for you, Min-ji.

11:28.396 --> 11:29.897
‎That was a good slap.

11:29.980 --> 11:31.148
‎Nice!

11:34.110 --> 11:36.237
‎What the hell are you staring at,
‎you filthy trash?

11:36.320 --> 11:37.530
‎I thought this was over.

11:38.072 --> 11:40.408
‎Get me transferred or expelled.

11:40.991 --> 11:42.159
‎Do whatever you want.

11:43.160 --> 11:44.829
‎Just ask your dad to do it.

11:47.498 --> 11:48.374
‎I don't want to.

11:49.583 --> 11:52.378
‎I'm going to make you get on your knees.

11:54.422 --> 11:55.714
‎Sorry,

11:55.798 --> 11:57.466
‎but I'm different from my dad.

12:00.553 --> 12:01.470
‎Oh.

12:03.472 --> 12:04.473
‎Are you?

12:07.601 --> 12:08.769
‎Try hitting me again.

12:09.520 --> 12:10.896
‎That's hilarious.

12:10.980 --> 12:11.856
‎Go ahead.

12:13.274 --> 12:15.693
‎Hit me, Min-ji. I said hit me!

12:18.487 --> 12:19.613
‎Let go of me!

12:21.240 --> 12:25.119
‎-Come on! Hit her! Hit her!
‎-Hit her!

12:26.370 --> 12:29.165
‎-Hey!
‎-Come on!

12:33.586 --> 12:34.503
‎You crazy bitch!

12:34.587 --> 12:35.963
‎Yeah, so what?

12:36.046 --> 12:37.006
‎Let go!

12:38.174 --> 12:39.425
‎Let go!

12:43.345 --> 12:44.305
‎Hye-ri, are you okay?

12:52.271 --> 12:54.398
‎You thought I wouldn't hit you
‎because you're a girl?

12:56.984 --> 12:58.652
‎They say birds of a feather
‎flock together.

12:59.195 --> 13:00.988
‎You're all so trashy.

13:02.406 --> 13:04.992
‎Look at you, ganging up to beat up a girl.

13:05.910 --> 13:06.827
‎-You got this. Come on!
‎-Hey!

13:06.911 --> 13:07.995
‎-You have a death wish?
‎-Let go!

13:12.041 --> 13:13.792
‎Damn it, just die!

13:30.976 --> 13:31.810
‎Min-ji!

13:31.894 --> 13:32.937
‎-Get up, Min-ji!
‎-Stop messing around.

13:33.020 --> 13:34.063
‎You little!

13:40.361 --> 13:42.571
‎-Hey, Min-ji!
‎-That's no fun.

13:45.616 --> 13:46.784
‎-There's blood.
‎-Blood?

13:47.660 --> 13:49.286
‎-Oh, crap. Wait.
‎-Oh, shit.

13:50.162 --> 13:51.622
‎-Goddamn it.
‎-Hold on.

13:51.705 --> 13:53.832
‎-Is she really dead?
‎-Damn it.

13:55.209 --> 13:57.461
‎-It's blood.
‎-Damn it!

13:59.088 --> 14:00.464
‎What's going on?

14:00.548 --> 14:01.674
‎You're kidding, right?

14:04.510 --> 14:05.511
‎Hey.

14:06.512 --> 14:07.638
‎Hey!

14:11.141 --> 14:12.434
‎Dad…

14:30.744 --> 14:32.538
‎-Is she really dead?
‎-Damn it.

14:33.163 --> 14:34.915
‎Goddamn it.

14:37.084 --> 14:38.210
‎DAD

14:38.294 --> 14:39.670
‎Someone call an ambulance.

14:39.753 --> 14:40.838
‎I'll do it.

14:41.797 --> 14:43.757
‎Stop right there. Don't do anything!

14:48.178 --> 14:49.930
‎-You're all accomplices.
‎-What are you talking about?

14:50.014 --> 14:52.182
‎Screw you. You all came here to trash her.

14:52.266 --> 14:53.392
‎If I get caught,

14:54.184 --> 14:56.228
‎I'll report every single one of you.

14:56.312 --> 14:57.521
‎Dad…

15:01.233 --> 15:02.818
‎I have nothing to lose.

15:03.444 --> 15:04.570
‎So think carefully.

15:05.529 --> 15:07.448
‎Collect everyone's phones already.

15:08.782 --> 15:11.201
‎-What for?
‎-Why are you taking our phones?

15:14.038 --> 15:16.332
‎Hey, don't worry.

15:16.415 --> 15:18.626
‎It'll be okay. I know who to call.

15:18.709 --> 15:20.669
‎They might be able to help, okay?

15:27.051 --> 15:28.302
‎-Look who it is.
‎-Hello, sir.

15:28.385 --> 15:29.970
‎Hey, punk!

15:32.348 --> 15:34.433
‎Collect all the money
‎by the end of the month.

15:34.516 --> 15:36.936
‎Charge a bit more interest
‎and keep the difference.

15:37.019 --> 15:38.437
‎Yes, sir. And here.

15:39.438 --> 15:41.106
‎I brought you this week's collection.

15:41.190 --> 15:42.775
‎Well, look at you.

15:44.276 --> 15:45.819
‎-Good job.
‎-Excuse me.

15:48.280 --> 15:49.281
‎What is it?

15:49.365 --> 15:52.242
‎SOUTH SIDE COLLECTOR
‎GOLDEN TEETH GANG, OH MIN-CHEOL

15:52.326 --> 15:53.661
‎Hello, sir.

15:53.744 --> 15:57.081
‎I accidentally…
‎I mean, we accidentally killed someone.

15:57.164 --> 15:58.165
‎So what?

15:58.248 --> 16:01.085
‎Is there any way to take care of the body?

16:01.168 --> 16:02.336
‎Are you insane?

16:02.419 --> 16:03.504
‎How the hell can I do that?

16:03.587 --> 16:06.757
‎Then could we ask someone higher up?

16:08.384 --> 16:10.844
‎My dad is Ju Gang-chan,
‎the chairman of Juhak Construction.

16:12.262 --> 16:15.599
‎I'll pay whatever you want,
‎so just get rid of the body.

16:15.683 --> 16:16.850
‎Hey.

16:16.934 --> 16:19.520
‎You expect me to believe your dad
‎is the chairman of Juhak Construction?

16:21.146 --> 16:21.981
‎Get lost!

16:24.274 --> 16:25.317
‎Hey, kid.

16:26.110 --> 16:27.695
‎Hello, boss.

16:29.822 --> 16:31.115
‎Who were you talking to?

16:31.198 --> 16:32.324
‎Oh, just one of my boys.

16:32.408 --> 16:34.827
‎-His name is Min-ho--
‎-No, no.

16:34.910 --> 16:38.414
‎You just said something
‎about Juhak Construction.

16:38.497 --> 16:40.124
‎Oh, some crazy kid was bullshitting

16:40.207 --> 16:42.835
‎that her dad is the chairman
‎of Juhak Construction.

16:45.129 --> 16:48.173
‎What exactly did she do?

16:48.257 --> 16:51.552
‎She accidentally killed someone
‎and asked me to get rid of the body.

16:52.344 --> 16:55.305
‎I think some punks just screwed up.
‎Don't worry about it, sir.

16:58.350 --> 17:00.352
‎Call her back

17:01.645 --> 17:03.063
‎and tell her I'll help.

17:04.064 --> 17:04.898
‎Excuse me?

17:07.443 --> 17:08.652
‎I said call her back.

17:09.778 --> 17:10.654
‎Yes, sir.

17:22.416 --> 17:23.876
‎Oh jeez. Right here, boss.

17:25.878 --> 17:26.879
‎My goodness.

17:29.631 --> 17:31.842
‎Man, this poor little thing…

17:35.763 --> 17:37.139
‎Move out of the way.

17:47.357 --> 17:48.734
‎Goodness.

17:48.817 --> 17:52.613
‎Why do you look so scared, Ms. Princess?

17:52.696 --> 17:55.074
‎You're nothing like your father.

17:57.034 --> 17:58.577
‎Money isn't a problem.

17:59.286 --> 18:00.621
‎I'll give you as much as you want.

18:00.704 --> 18:02.331
‎Come on now.

18:02.414 --> 18:04.166
‎I have a lot of money.

18:04.249 --> 18:06.835
‎I usually don't bother
‎with things like this.

18:06.919 --> 18:11.256
‎But I owe Chairman Ju,
‎so I'm making an exception to help you.

18:11.340 --> 18:12.674
‎I don't care!

18:13.842 --> 18:16.261
‎Just make sure no one finds out.

18:17.888 --> 18:18.931
‎Tell me.

18:19.973 --> 18:21.391
‎You can take care of the body, right?

18:21.475 --> 18:22.309
‎Hey!

18:26.522 --> 18:30.734
‎You know what? You talk just like him.
‎You're definitely Chairman Ju's daughter.

18:32.611 --> 18:33.445
‎Hey.

18:45.249 --> 18:46.208
‎Don't worry.

18:47.000 --> 18:49.628
‎We just need to slice her open,
‎pull out her guts,

18:49.711 --> 18:53.173
‎stitch her back up nicely,
‎and throw her into the sea.

18:53.257 --> 18:54.091
‎That's it.

18:54.716 --> 18:55.634
‎Nobody will find her.

18:58.095 --> 19:01.890
‎Boss, why bother pulling out the guts?
‎It gets so messy.

19:01.974 --> 19:04.893
‎Come on, you sound like an amateur.

19:04.977 --> 19:07.563
‎You have to remove the organs
‎so the body doesn't float to the surface.

19:07.646 --> 19:11.191
‎And if it's buried in the mountains,
‎wild animals won't dig it up, you idiot.

19:11.275 --> 19:12.109
‎Got it, boss.

19:12.192 --> 19:15.821
‎You see, wild animals sniff out
‎and eat the organs first.

19:19.199 --> 19:20.742
‎-Hey, Gang-min.
‎-Yes?

19:20.826 --> 19:22.911
‎Let's have soju
‎and blood sausage after this.

19:22.995 --> 19:25.747
‎-I'm craving organ meats.
‎-Sounds great, sir.

19:25.831 --> 19:28.584
‎Boss, I want extra liver.

19:28.667 --> 19:29.960
‎I want extra rice.

19:31.086 --> 19:32.045
‎What about you, kid?

19:32.546 --> 19:33.672
‎I've already eaten, sir.

19:34.923 --> 19:35.757
‎You have?

19:39.469 --> 19:40.846
‎All right, you're home.

19:44.183 --> 19:47.102
‎Look at that. What a nice house.

19:48.896 --> 19:50.814
‎Excuse me, Ms. Get-Rid-of-The-Body.

19:54.193 --> 19:55.944
‎Let's keep this a secret from your father.

19:56.945 --> 20:00.991
‎It won't be good for either of us
‎if we worry him for no good reason.

20:05.162 --> 20:06.163
‎Keep your promise.

20:07.080 --> 20:09.208
‎Gang-min, let's go pull out some guts.

20:09.291 --> 20:10.709
‎Yes, boss.

20:10.792 --> 20:12.878
‎Bye, pretty girl.

20:37.861 --> 20:38.946
‎Tell me.

20:40.614 --> 20:41.573
‎Where's Min-ji?

20:45.077 --> 20:46.411
‎Tell me.

20:46.495 --> 20:47.371
‎Where is she?

20:47.996 --> 20:49.248
‎Oh Min-cheol…

20:50.874 --> 20:52.793
‎I was just trying to scare her,

20:53.418 --> 20:55.254
‎but she fell while running away.

20:57.214 --> 20:58.423
‎I'm sorry.

21:00.342 --> 21:01.301
‎Keep talking.

21:02.094 --> 21:03.845
‎I called Min-cheol.

21:04.471 --> 21:05.931
‎I don't know what happened after that

21:06.014 --> 21:07.516
‎because I ran away too.

21:08.016 --> 21:09.977
‎Please, you have to believe me.

21:11.144 --> 21:12.396
‎Oh Min-cheol.

21:12.479 --> 21:14.022
‎Where is he right now?

21:26.618 --> 21:27.703
‎Dad.

21:49.683 --> 21:50.559
‎Dad.

21:51.685 --> 21:52.519
‎What's going on?

21:53.353 --> 21:54.479
‎You didn't go to work?

22:04.197 --> 22:06.325
‎Why did you get soaked in the rain?

22:10.871 --> 22:11.997
‎What's the matter with you?

22:13.248 --> 22:15.208
‎I'm hungry. Is there anything to eat?

22:33.393 --> 22:36.271
‎SANGSAENG SAVINGS BANK

22:38.398 --> 22:39.691
‎Well, this is new.

22:39.775 --> 22:41.485
‎He's never been late before.

22:45.280 --> 22:46.698
‎Have you heard from Kim?

22:46.782 --> 22:49.242
‎BREAK ROOM

22:49.326 --> 22:50.619
‎I'll try calling him.

23:42.712 --> 23:43.713
‎SANG-A

24:21.710 --> 24:22.836
‎I'm sorry.

24:22.919 --> 24:24.671
‎Please give me another chance.

24:24.754 --> 24:26.089
‎Please let my daughter go.

24:26.756 --> 24:28.592
‎Please.

24:28.675 --> 24:30.343
‎You think this is a joke, mister?

24:31.011 --> 24:33.805
‎If you borrow money,
‎you have to pay it back.

24:33.889 --> 24:35.932
‎Hey, Hong-sik.
‎I think we need to refresh his memory.

24:36.016 --> 24:37.142
‎Read him the contract.

24:40.520 --> 24:43.565
‎"If I fail to pay back the money
‎within the agreed period,

24:44.649 --> 24:46.526
‎I will sign over
‎my family members' organs."

24:46.610 --> 24:48.195
‎-Dad!
‎-No!

24:48.278 --> 24:50.322
‎No, no, no! That's not true!

24:50.405 --> 24:52.699
‎There was nothing like that
‎in the contract!

24:52.782 --> 24:54.618
‎It's called a special clause.

24:54.701 --> 24:55.827
‎Dad!

24:56.328 --> 24:57.913
‎I added the special clause.

24:57.996 --> 25:00.874
‎Please forgive me! Spare my daughter!

25:00.957 --> 25:01.791
‎Please!

25:01.875 --> 25:04.044
‎Goddamn it, you're getting blood on me!

25:04.127 --> 25:05.545
‎-Damn it.
‎-Not my daughter…

25:06.254 --> 25:07.255
‎Hey, mister.

25:08.506 --> 25:09.424
‎I'm pretty sure

25:10.425 --> 25:11.593
‎students have organs too.

25:12.385 --> 25:13.595
‎Hey, kid. Come here.

25:14.179 --> 25:15.597
‎Come on.

25:15.680 --> 25:17.224
‎-No, no, no.
‎-Hey.

25:17.307 --> 25:18.225
‎Look up.

25:18.308 --> 25:21.937
‎Eyes, heart, kidneys, and pancreas.
‎Looks like she has them all. Take her.

25:22.020 --> 25:26.233
‎-Dad! Dad!
‎-No! No, please!

25:26.316 --> 25:27.943
‎Dad!

25:28.026 --> 25:29.402
‎-Get in there.
‎-Dad!

25:30.111 --> 25:32.155
‎Get away from me!

25:32.239 --> 25:33.865
‎-Go away!
‎-It'll be over quickly.

25:34.491 --> 25:35.325
‎Go away!

25:35.408 --> 25:36.534
‎It'll only take a second.

25:36.618 --> 25:38.745
‎No, stop! Stop it!

25:42.374 --> 25:44.334
‎-Did you order delivery?
‎-Sorry?

25:44.918 --> 25:46.086
‎Did you order delivery?

25:46.169 --> 25:48.672
‎Hong-sik ordered macarons earlier
‎but canceled them.

25:48.755 --> 25:50.131
‎Macarons? Seriously, Hong-sik?

25:50.215 --> 25:51.508
‎But I canceled the order.

25:52.884 --> 25:53.969
‎Maybe they got the wrong house.

25:54.052 --> 25:55.887
‎Hey, send them away.

25:55.971 --> 25:56.805
‎Okay.

25:56.888 --> 25:58.473
‎Close the door behind you just in case.

25:58.556 --> 25:59.391
‎Okay.

26:00.976 --> 26:02.936
‎Hey, go check it out.

26:03.019 --> 26:04.062
‎On it.

26:10.068 --> 26:10.902
‎Is she under yet?

26:14.281 --> 26:15.282
‎What was that?

27:01.328 --> 27:02.162
‎What's that noise?

27:31.941 --> 27:32.776
‎Hey, Hong-sik.

27:53.088 --> 27:55.507
‎Please spare me. I'm not with them.

27:55.590 --> 27:56.758
‎Please don't kill me.

28:00.887 --> 28:02.472
‎What the hell? Is he a cop?

28:12.357 --> 28:13.775
‎Who the hell set that up?

28:26.579 --> 28:28.706
‎What the hell? Damn it!

28:30.083 --> 28:31.543
‎Who the hell are you, bastard?

28:34.754 --> 28:37.674
‎SAFE AND HAPPY DOWON POLICE STATION

28:39.759 --> 28:40.593
‎Excuse me.

28:41.678 --> 28:42.762
‎Excuse me!

28:43.304 --> 28:45.056
‎Why am I here?

28:45.140 --> 28:47.100
‎I didn't fight anyone.

28:47.934 --> 28:48.768
‎Excuse me.

28:49.644 --> 28:50.645
‎Hey, mister!

28:50.729 --> 28:52.897
‎Be quiet, will you?

28:54.149 --> 28:56.609
‎You have to wait until we finish
‎examining the CCTV footage.

28:56.693 --> 28:57.819
‎Is that really necessary?

28:57.902 --> 29:01.281
‎Let me reiterate
‎that I didn't lay a finger on any of them.

29:01.364 --> 29:05.702
‎All I did was stop that wild boar
‎from going on a rampage.

29:06.661 --> 29:07.495
‎Excuse me!

29:08.121 --> 29:09.247
‎Hey, mister!

29:09.330 --> 29:10.331
‎I…

29:10.415 --> 29:11.249
‎Hey, you punk!

29:12.083 --> 29:14.753
‎Explain to him what happened!

29:14.836 --> 29:17.338
‎Tell him you lost your mind
‎and acted alone!

29:23.636 --> 29:26.598
‎Mister, is that bastard
‎sleeping right now?

29:27.390 --> 29:28.850
‎In this situation?

29:28.933 --> 29:30.268
‎Are you serious?!

29:31.019 --> 29:32.270
‎EVERYONE, I SAW IT!

29:32.353 --> 29:33.980
‎I SAW A FULL-ON STREET BRAWL!

29:34.063 --> 29:35.064
‎NEVER SEEN A 17-TO-1 FIGHT BEFORE

29:35.148 --> 29:37.025
‎Oh my goodness.

29:38.026 --> 29:39.736
‎Here you go.

29:39.819 --> 29:41.905
‎What's so interesting?

29:41.988 --> 29:43.948
‎This man is amazing. Here, watch.

29:45.408 --> 29:48.787
‎Goodness, he's just barbaric.

29:48.870 --> 29:50.497
‎Right, he is.

29:51.581 --> 29:52.707
‎My word.

29:52.791 --> 29:54.167
‎Oh dear.

29:57.670 --> 29:59.506
‎GENERAL BUREAU OF INTELLIGENCE
‎ON SOUTH KOREA

29:59.589 --> 30:01.090
‎MEDIA SURVEILLANCE ROOM

30:05.470 --> 30:06.429
‎MANGYUN-DONG BBQ RESTAURANT ASSAULT

30:06.513 --> 30:09.098
‎TATTOOED THUGS GETTING CRUSHED
‎BY MIDDLE-AGED MARINE GUY

30:22.111 --> 30:22.946
‎THREAT LEVEL
‎TIER ONE

30:29.994 --> 30:31.871
‎A tier-one wanted fugitive
‎has been caught on camera.

30:31.955 --> 30:34.791
‎WHO IS THE CITIZEN WHO SHUT DOWN
‎THE TROUBLEMAKERS AT A BBQ RESTAURANT?

30:41.548 --> 30:46.135
‎MOST WANTED FUGITIVE
‎THREAT LEVEL: TIER ONE

30:46.219 --> 30:49.222
‎That spy son of a bitch.

30:49.305 --> 30:53.518
‎I thought he was dead,
‎but he turned up like a ghost.

30:54.185 --> 30:55.520
‎We should head to the South

30:56.145 --> 30:58.565
‎and bring back his head immediately.

30:58.648 --> 31:00.859
‎-Arm the infiltration team.
‎-Yes, sir.

31:00.942 --> 31:01.818
‎Hold on.

31:03.653 --> 31:04.779
‎We can't do that.

31:04.863 --> 31:07.657
‎The high-level inter-Korean talks
‎are less than a month away.

31:08.241 --> 31:11.327
‎Carrying out a covert operation
‎at a time like this

31:11.411 --> 31:13.580
‎won't do us any good.

31:13.663 --> 31:14.706
‎I agree.

31:14.789 --> 31:17.917
‎It would be best to officially request
‎cooperation from the South.

31:18.001 --> 31:21.629
‎We'll have our operatives
‎accompany the delegation

31:21.713 --> 31:23.464
‎and make the arrest then.

31:23.548 --> 31:24.507
‎I agree.

31:26.134 --> 31:28.386
‎Have you all lost your minds?

31:29.387 --> 31:33.474
‎Have you forgotten
‎what that bastard did to the Republic?

31:34.058 --> 31:35.727
‎GENERAL BUREAU OF INTELLIGENCE
‎ON SOUTH KOREA

31:35.810 --> 31:36.978
‎DIRECTOR GENERAL RI EUNG RYEONG

31:37.061 --> 31:39.606
‎Comrade Director General,
‎you're out of line!

31:39.689 --> 31:41.941
‎Do you want your head to roll first?

31:42.859 --> 31:47.614
‎That bastard is a traitor to the regime
‎who's become a lapdog for the South!

31:47.697 --> 31:48.990
‎Shut it!

31:49.991 --> 31:51.159
‎That's enough.

31:51.659 --> 31:53.745
‎Follow the orders of the Party.

31:57.248 --> 31:59.250
‎DIRECTOR GENERAL RI EUNG RYEONG

31:59.334 --> 32:01.169
‎They may be highly decorated,

32:01.252 --> 32:03.296
‎but they're still wet behind the ears.

32:03.379 --> 32:05.381
‎They've grown soft from peacetime
‎and lost their minds.

32:05.465 --> 32:09.552
‎Since when have we had to tiptoe around
‎the bastards in the South?

32:15.266 --> 32:17.810
‎Those damn greenhorns

32:19.270 --> 32:20.438
‎think they can arrest him?

32:20.521 --> 32:23.441
‎It's impossible to capture that man alive.

32:23.524 --> 32:26.736
‎Don't you think our warriors
‎are more than up for the task?

32:26.819 --> 32:28.363
‎Not a chance.

32:28.446 --> 32:30.531
‎Unless it's someone like Park Yeong Gwang.

32:31.324 --> 32:32.492
‎Park Yeong Gwang?

32:33.409 --> 32:35.161
‎Are you referring to Number 66?

32:35.244 --> 32:37.330
‎That's right, 66.

32:48.841 --> 32:50.843
‎He truly deserved the title

32:50.927 --> 32:53.846
‎of the greatest warrior
‎in our unit's history.

33:06.526 --> 33:08.903
‎He single-handedly took out

33:08.987 --> 33:11.155
‎an entire South Korean commando platoon.

33:11.239 --> 33:14.659
‎But didn't Park Yeong Gwang
‎die in action a long time ago?

33:18.121 --> 33:19.288
‎Damn it.

33:19.831 --> 33:23.710
‎If only that traitor
‎hadn't stabbed him in the back…

33:26.421 --> 33:27.255
‎Hey.

33:28.464 --> 33:30.299
‎Isn't Park Yeong Gwang's younger brother

33:30.383 --> 33:32.677
‎one of our operatives?

33:33.469 --> 33:36.723
‎Yes, sir. He's an elite warrior
‎who's just as skilled as Number 66.

33:37.724 --> 33:38.933
‎Is that so?

33:40.143 --> 33:41.602
‎How fortunate.

33:43.479 --> 33:44.981
‎Bring him to me now.

33:45.064 --> 33:45.898
‎Yes, sir.

33:54.365 --> 33:56.576
‎His older brother had his number stolen,

33:57.201 --> 33:59.162
‎so it's up to him to get it back.

34:00.038 --> 34:00.872
‎Naturally.

34:04.208 --> 34:08.046
‎REPUBLIC OF KOREA
‎SPECIAL MISSIONS DIRECTORATE

34:15.344 --> 34:17.180
‎Director, we have a situation.

34:17.263 --> 34:18.097
‎Report.

34:18.181 --> 34:20.224
‎Unusual activity involving Agent Kim,
‎our top surveillance subject,

34:20.308 --> 34:21.684
‎has been reported.

34:21.768 --> 34:22.727
‎Unusual activity?

34:26.439 --> 34:29.192
‎Name, Park Jin-cheol. Former ROK soldier.

34:29.275 --> 34:33.112
‎On active duty, he infiltrated the North
‎on multiple missions with Agent Kim.

34:33.196 --> 34:34.864
‎His military record includes

34:34.947 --> 34:36.699
‎three airstrike operations
‎against Palestine,

34:36.783 --> 34:38.951
‎the elimination
‎of the radical militant group, LSS,

34:39.035 --> 34:41.788
‎serving in Operation Indira
‎to decimate a Pakistani terrorist group,

34:41.871 --> 34:43.956
‎-defensive combat operations in--
‎-Hey.

34:44.040 --> 34:45.583
‎You think I don't know
‎who Park Jin-cheol is?

34:45.666 --> 34:46.667
‎Just report the situation.

34:46.751 --> 34:49.670
‎Footage of Park Jin-cheol's rampage
‎three days ago

34:49.754 --> 34:53.424
‎was captured by North Korean intelligence,
‎exposing Agent Kim who was with him.

34:54.926 --> 34:56.260
‎You've got to be kidding me.

34:56.969 --> 34:59.430
‎CODENAME MOLE CRICKET
‎SMD DIRECTOR KANG GUK-CHEOL

35:01.891 --> 35:04.977
‎RESTRICTED AREA

35:05.561 --> 35:08.898
‎The North issued an official arrest notice
‎through the hotline 45 minutes ago.

35:09.524 --> 35:11.692
‎They've requested North Korean operatives

35:11.776 --> 35:14.237
‎to enter the country
‎during the high-level inter-Korean talks.

35:15.863 --> 35:17.782
‎Sir, this is unacceptable.

35:20.284 --> 35:22.745
‎This means giving spies free rein
‎to roam our country.

35:25.039 --> 35:27.416
‎The government denies
‎Agent Kim's existence,

35:27.500 --> 35:30.962
‎but the longer we stall, the more likely
‎they'll have to grant the North's request.

35:34.006 --> 35:36.926
‎We can't hand over someone
‎as dangerous as Kim to the North.

35:39.762 --> 35:41.097
‎We'll get to him first.

35:41.180 --> 35:42.140
‎-Yes, sir.
‎-Understood.

35:50.648 --> 35:52.817
‎I swear I don't know anything.

35:52.900 --> 35:54.277
‎We operate in small cells.

35:54.902 --> 35:58.156
‎We get invited to Telgram
‎when the higher-ups need something.

35:58.948 --> 36:00.116
‎What's that?

36:01.784 --> 36:04.120
‎You wouldn't know
‎even if I told you, boomer.

36:10.084 --> 36:12.503
‎There must be a mosquito in here.

36:13.129 --> 36:14.505
‎Or did a bitch just pinch me?

36:15.506 --> 36:16.382
‎All right.

36:32.690 --> 36:33.566
‎I'll pinch you.

36:33.649 --> 36:34.483
‎No, no, no.

36:39.614 --> 36:41.532
‎It's an anonymous group chat!

36:41.616 --> 36:44.202
‎Like texting!

36:46.913 --> 36:48.623
‎Are you ready to talk now?

36:51.292 --> 36:52.627
‎Get in touch with them right now.

36:53.211 --> 36:54.837
‎How many times do I have to tell you?

36:55.546 --> 36:57.298
‎Unless they reach out first,

36:57.381 --> 36:59.258
‎there's no way to contact them.

36:59.342 --> 37:03.221
‎And they delete the chat room
‎when they're done.

37:03.304 --> 37:04.263
‎Got it?

37:05.556 --> 37:07.016
‎Hey, is anybody out there?

37:07.099 --> 37:08.559
‎Come stab this bastard!

37:08.643 --> 37:10.061
‎Stab him, damn it!

37:10.144 --> 37:11.145
‎Hong-sik!

37:11.229 --> 37:13.272
‎Those fucking idiots.

37:15.566 --> 37:17.068
‎What makes you so confident?

37:17.902 --> 37:19.153
‎The law!

37:19.237 --> 37:20.279
‎The damn law!

37:21.030 --> 37:23.699
‎I'm going to sue you.

37:23.783 --> 37:25.785
‎I'll sue you for assault, torture,

37:25.868 --> 37:27.912
‎unlawful confinement,
‎and for threatening me!

37:27.995 --> 37:29.538
‎Your life is over.

37:30.206 --> 37:31.040
‎The law?

37:31.666 --> 37:32.500
‎You?

37:33.292 --> 37:34.835
‎You see,

37:34.919 --> 37:37.797
‎the law has nothing to do with us.

37:38.297 --> 37:39.632
‎We're minors.

37:40.174 --> 37:42.969
‎Don't you know what a no-charge minor is,
‎you damn boomer?

37:51.102 --> 37:53.104
‎If you lose your parents,
‎you're an orphan.

37:55.606 --> 37:57.692
‎If you lose your husband, you're a widow.

37:59.902 --> 38:00.778
‎But you know,

38:01.821 --> 38:03.406
‎there's no word for a parent

38:04.198 --> 38:05.491
‎who loses their child.

38:07.618 --> 38:09.829
‎The sight of their grief
‎is too wretched to name.

38:11.580 --> 38:13.624
‎It's as if they have nothing left to lose.

38:14.542 --> 38:15.418
‎Hey.

38:15.501 --> 38:17.336
‎That's fake, right?

38:17.420 --> 38:19.588
‎How can you have a gun in Korea?

38:19.672 --> 38:20.548
‎No-charge minor, huh?

38:21.465 --> 38:22.425
‎Nicely put.

38:24.677 --> 38:25.928
‎I guess…

38:28.389 --> 38:29.890
‎I'll just be a middle-aged outlaw.

38:30.766 --> 38:31.892
‎Wait, hold on.

38:31.976 --> 38:34.103
‎Listen, I'm not a minor.

38:34.186 --> 38:36.105
‎I'm not underage!

38:36.188 --> 38:39.275
‎Those guys out there are minors,
‎but I'm over 20!

38:46.574 --> 38:48.492
‎Call an ambulance…

38:48.576 --> 38:50.995
‎Please take me to the hospital.

38:52.121 --> 38:54.832
‎I'm only keeping you alive
‎because I believe my daughter is.

38:55.875 --> 38:56.751
‎If she's not,

38:58.127 --> 39:00.838
‎you, your friends, and your family

39:01.464 --> 39:02.381
‎will all die.

39:05.343 --> 39:07.178
‎HEY, MIN-CHEOL

39:15.603 --> 39:16.437
‎Hey, Min-cheol.

39:16.520 --> 39:19.398
‎Make sure the kids keep their mouths shut.

40:00.940 --> 40:02.733
‎Why is this bastard calling me?

40:02.817 --> 40:03.734
‎What is it?

40:03.818 --> 40:06.737
‎I messaged him as you told me to,

40:06.821 --> 40:08.364
‎but he's calling.

40:08.447 --> 40:10.449
‎He usually asks before he calls.

40:10.533 --> 40:12.118
‎Maybe something happened.

40:12.743 --> 40:14.203
‎Answer it.

40:14.286 --> 40:15.121
‎Don't answer it.

40:15.871 --> 40:16.789
‎It's the police.

40:17.998 --> 40:19.875
‎Delete the chat room first,

40:20.501 --> 40:22.753
‎and don't take any calls
‎from those kids for the time being.

40:22.837 --> 40:24.004
‎Yes, sir.

40:24.088 --> 40:26.799
‎And just to be safe,
‎get rid of that phone.

40:26.882 --> 40:27.967
‎Yes, sir.

40:29.760 --> 40:31.637
‎The person you are trying to reach
‎is unavailable.

40:31.720 --> 40:34.974
‎You will be redirected to voicemail
‎after the beep, and charges will apply…

40:35.558 --> 40:38.394
‎I took care of the girl's body.

40:38.477 --> 40:40.479
‎UNABLE TO ACCESS CONVERSATION

40:42.273 --> 40:44.859
‎CLOSE

41:02.376 --> 41:03.544
‎Contact them now.

41:06.255 --> 41:09.300
‎They deleted the chat room,

41:10.384 --> 41:12.344
‎so we can't contact them from our end.

41:13.637 --> 41:14.472
‎Please.

41:15.139 --> 41:15.973
‎Contact them.

41:16.056 --> 41:19.059
‎I swear. I seriously can't.

41:19.143 --> 41:22.438
‎The server is overseas.

41:40.331 --> 41:41.207
‎Please.

41:45.961 --> 41:47.713
‎Please don't kill me!

42:26.210 --> 42:28.754
‎HIGH SCHOOL GIRL'S BODY DISCOVERED

42:28.837 --> 42:31.090
‎MISSING HIGH SCHOOL GIRL
‎FOUND DEAD IN THE WOODS

42:31.173 --> 42:34.718
‎HIGH SCHOOL GIRL'S BODY
‎DISCOVERED UNDER A BRIDGE

42:39.765 --> 42:41.141
‎This is your hair tie, right?

42:41.225 --> 42:42.393
‎It was on the ground.

42:44.478 --> 42:45.813
‎It's yours, right?

43:08.460 --> 43:09.378
‎Is Hye-ri sleeping?

43:11.005 --> 43:12.214
‎I don't know.

43:12.298 --> 43:13.757
‎She hasn't come out of her room all day.

43:27.271 --> 43:29.189
‎Why didn't you come out if you were awake?

43:29.273 --> 43:30.524
‎I just got home from work.

43:31.358 --> 43:33.694
‎How was your day, Dad?

43:36.572 --> 43:37.656
‎You don't look so good.

43:37.740 --> 43:38.907
‎Are you feeling sick?

43:38.991 --> 43:41.327
‎I'm just a little tired.

43:43.746 --> 43:45.789
‎It's because of Min-ji, isn't it?

43:46.957 --> 43:48.417
‎No, it's not.

43:48.500 --> 43:50.127
‎I'm really okay now.

43:51.545 --> 43:53.130
‎Let it go, Hye-ri.

43:53.213 --> 43:55.466
‎If you think about it,
‎she's a pitiful girl.

43:56.342 --> 43:59.637
‎She turned out crude
‎because she grew up in a troubled home.

44:02.556 --> 44:03.766
‎Do you happen to know

44:04.767 --> 44:06.852
‎what her dad does for a living?

44:06.935 --> 44:08.062
‎Why do you ask?

44:10.939 --> 44:11.857
‎I don't know.

44:11.940 --> 44:13.692
‎I'm just curious.

44:20.199 --> 44:21.033
‎Hye-ri.

44:22.618 --> 44:23.452
‎Yes?

44:24.036 --> 44:26.038
‎From now on, don't take it lying down.

44:26.664 --> 44:28.082
‎Make them pay several times over.

44:28.666 --> 44:30.626
‎Don't ever let people think
‎you're an easy target.

44:30.709 --> 44:32.920
‎Make them so afraid
‎to look you in the eye.

44:34.338 --> 44:37.591
‎Make them so afraid
‎their knees buckle when they see you.

44:39.301 --> 44:40.761
‎That way, they'll never come at you.

44:45.891 --> 44:46.934
‎Don't worry.

44:48.018 --> 44:50.521
‎If there's anything
‎you can't handle on your own,

44:51.146 --> 44:52.523
‎I'll protect you.

44:56.777 --> 44:59.154
‎Boss, I just don't get it.

44:59.947 --> 45:00.864
‎What do you mean?

45:00.948 --> 45:02.324
‎You know, the daughter of the chairman.

45:02.408 --> 45:04.034
‎Why did you let her go
‎without getting paid?

45:04.118 --> 45:07.204
‎Juhak Construction is a huge company.
‎We could've scored big, no?

45:07.287 --> 45:10.582
‎With a little blackmail,
‎we could've sucked them dry.

45:11.708 --> 45:13.627
‎I feel the same way too, boss.

45:13.710 --> 45:16.171
‎I don't understand
‎why you just let her go.

45:16.255 --> 45:18.090
‎If we make a move without thinking,

45:18.882 --> 45:20.008
‎we'll get eaten alive.

45:20.092 --> 45:21.427
‎-Sorry?
‎-Sorry?

45:21.510 --> 45:22.761
‎Ju Gang-chan…

45:25.139 --> 45:27.057
‎That man will eat us alive.

45:34.148 --> 45:36.150
‎He isn't your average guy.

45:37.860 --> 45:42.197
‎He started as a hired thug and ended up
‎taking over construction companies.

45:44.199 --> 45:45.117
‎My apologies, sir.

45:45.200 --> 45:47.161
‎If you can delay construction
‎until next month,

45:47.244 --> 45:49.288
‎we'll make sure
‎to finish demolition this month.

45:49.872 --> 45:53.083
‎You said the same thing last time.

45:53.167 --> 45:55.043
‎The other side brought in hired thugs, so…

45:56.170 --> 45:57.004
‎I'm sorry, sir.

45:59.965 --> 46:01.550
‎Are you really sorry?

46:02.134 --> 46:03.719
‎I don't feel your sincerity.

46:05.012 --> 46:05.846
‎That's not true, sir.

46:06.972 --> 46:08.557
‎I truly mean it, sir.

46:11.101 --> 46:12.394
‎What are you thinking right now?

46:13.479 --> 46:14.313
‎Excuse me?

46:15.939 --> 46:18.150
‎"I got down on my knees,
‎so surely he'll let it slide."

46:18.942 --> 46:21.111
‎"I just want this to be over."

46:23.197 --> 46:25.824
‎"If this fails after everything I've done,
‎that's on you."

46:28.118 --> 46:30.078
‎Isn't that what you're thinking?

46:30.162 --> 46:30.996
‎Not at all, sir.

46:31.079 --> 46:33.332
‎I sincerely apologize.

46:33.415 --> 46:34.500
‎Okay.

46:34.583 --> 46:37.002
‎Then let's get a genuine apology
‎out of you.

46:38.378 --> 46:39.880
‎He calls them bodyguards,

46:39.963 --> 46:43.342
‎but he runs a whole organization
‎of ex-special forces mercenaries.

46:44.301 --> 46:46.428
‎If money doesn't work,
‎then he uses violence.

46:46.929 --> 46:47.846
‎And if that doesn't work…

46:47.930 --> 46:48.764
‎Sir!

46:52.226 --> 46:53.352
‎I'm sorry, sir!

46:54.603 --> 46:56.063
‎-Please forgive me.
‎-Bow lower.

47:05.405 --> 47:06.657
‎I'm sorry, sir!

47:08.367 --> 47:09.201
‎Sir!

47:14.456 --> 47:16.458
‎Man, that's insane.

47:16.542 --> 47:18.252
‎He sounds like a total psychopath.

47:18.335 --> 47:19.336
‎Boss.

47:19.419 --> 47:22.214
‎Then why did you agree
‎to take care of the girl's body?

47:22.923 --> 47:26.134
‎I already told you that I owe Chairman Ju.

47:26.218 --> 47:27.094
‎Owe him what?

47:27.177 --> 47:29.221
‎It's none of your business, punk.

47:29.304 --> 47:31.974
‎You have too many questions
‎and too many cravings.

47:33.642 --> 47:34.851
‎And too much facial hair.

47:38.981 --> 47:41.608
‎I'll see you soon, Chairman Ju.

48:18.770 --> 48:20.188
‎This is as far as we can go.

49:12.866 --> 49:15.577
‎Your brother was the best operative

49:15.661 --> 49:18.038
‎this unit has ever seen.

49:19.122 --> 49:20.916
‎That's how 66 became the number

49:20.999 --> 49:24.461
‎that symbolizes
‎the Republic's finest warrior.

49:25.212 --> 49:27.297
‎But during a mission,

49:27.381 --> 49:30.092
‎some rat-bastard stabbed him in the back

49:30.717 --> 49:32.260
‎and got him killed.

49:32.344 --> 49:34.680
‎That rat-bastard traitor

49:34.763 --> 49:37.641
‎killed all of his comrades,

49:37.724 --> 49:40.644
‎stole the number 66 from your brother,

49:40.727 --> 49:43.814
‎and became a lapdog for the South!

49:50.779 --> 49:54.324
‎I'm giving you number 66,
‎the number that belonged to your brother.

50:01.039 --> 50:05.836
‎Go to the South and bring me back
‎the head of the fake Number 66.

50:38.285 --> 50:40.704
‎I couldn't locate the target.

50:42.289 --> 50:43.165
‎Here.

50:44.416 --> 50:45.625
‎This is the police station

50:45.709 --> 50:49.546
‎where the guy he was with is being held.

50:50.046 --> 50:52.299
‎One more thing.

50:53.550 --> 50:54.718
‎The thing is,

50:54.801 --> 50:57.929
‎our operational funds were cut off
‎a long time ago,

50:58.013 --> 51:00.807
‎so our comrades here are struggling.

51:00.891 --> 51:03.310
‎When you finish the mission and head back,

51:03.393 --> 51:06.646
‎please ask them to replenish the funds.

51:08.523 --> 51:09.649
‎Comrade.

51:10.942 --> 51:13.487
‎I think you've been in the South too long.

51:18.283 --> 51:19.826
‎Oh, well…

51:20.452 --> 51:22.287
‎Here's the car key.

51:31.463 --> 51:32.881
‎42 MYEONGUN-RO, DOWON-GU, SEOUL
‎DOWON POLICE STATION

51:38.887 --> 51:41.807
‎How can he sleep in a situation like this?

51:43.350 --> 51:44.726
‎That beast.

51:45.769 --> 51:48.605
‎Why do I have to suffer
‎because of that wild boar?

51:49.731 --> 51:53.401
‎If I ever talk to Park Jin-cheol again,
‎I'm no better than an animal.

52:11.002 --> 52:12.045
‎It's just my imagination.

52:13.004 --> 52:14.714
‎I'm imagining things because of that jerk.

52:19.135 --> 52:20.554
‎When will I get out?

52:26.393 --> 52:27.394
‎I'm hungry.

52:31.731 --> 52:32.732
‎Da-bin…

53:02.554 --> 53:03.555
‎Excuse me.

53:04.723 --> 53:06.099
‎Can I get something to eat?

53:06.600 --> 53:09.853
‎Come on, shouldn't you at least feed us?

53:10.353 --> 53:12.856
‎I know we're in lockup,

53:12.939 --> 53:16.276
‎but police officers in this country
‎should bring us food when…

53:16.359 --> 53:17.277
‎Oh, it's here?

53:18.445 --> 53:19.446
‎Here it is.

53:19.529 --> 53:21.573
‎Salute. Thank you for your hard work.

53:21.656 --> 53:23.491
‎Sir, can you tell me
‎what's on today's menu?

53:23.575 --> 53:24.993
‎Are you Park Jin-cheol?

53:26.828 --> 53:28.246
‎Well, that came out of nowhere.

53:32.792 --> 53:33.960
‎Your clothes look big on you.

53:34.586 --> 53:36.421
‎You should've found someone your size.

53:36.504 --> 53:38.590
‎Don't make this hard. Where's 66?

53:39.341 --> 53:40.383
‎Did you say 66?

53:42.427 --> 53:43.970
‎What's that?

53:44.054 --> 53:47.641
‎-The South's most elite operative.
‎-Oh.

53:48.642 --> 53:50.060
‎Did you come from the North?

53:51.853 --> 53:53.229
‎You've come to the right place.

53:53.855 --> 53:55.273
‎It's me.

53:55.857 --> 53:56.858
‎You're funny.

53:57.442 --> 53:59.527
‎-You're not 66.
‎-Come on.

53:59.611 --> 54:01.321
‎I can wear a size 66, or medium,
‎if I lose weight.

54:06.076 --> 54:07.202
‎Now, where have I seen him?

54:08.828 --> 54:09.996
‎Oh.

54:12.415 --> 54:13.458
‎Is it this person?

54:14.793 --> 54:16.336
‎You bastard.

54:18.713 --> 54:20.423
‎I'll ask you one last time.

54:21.007 --> 54:23.051
‎Where's 66?

54:23.134 --> 54:23.969
‎Hey, now.

54:24.052 --> 54:26.179
‎This isn't fair. There are civilians here.

54:30.183 --> 54:31.935
‎Hold on a second.

54:32.018 --> 54:34.020
‎789-9, Mangyun-dong.

54:34.604 --> 54:35.730
‎Second floor above Dowon Laundry.

54:35.814 --> 54:37.649
‎That's his address. Satisfied now?

54:39.442 --> 54:42.070
‎You're softer than you look.

54:42.153 --> 54:43.071
‎I look soft too, man.

54:43.780 --> 54:44.698
‎Then again,

54:44.781 --> 54:46.741
‎maybe it's better
‎to die sooner than later.

54:48.243 --> 54:49.327
‎Okay.

54:49.411 --> 54:51.579
‎I'll kill him quickly for your sake.

54:51.663 --> 54:52.580
‎No.

54:55.041 --> 54:56.418
‎I meant that you'll die.

54:56.501 --> 54:58.128
‎You son of a bitch.

54:58.795 --> 55:01.297
‎What's taking so long? Is there a problem?

55:03.133 --> 55:04.009
‎I'll see you again.

55:06.261 --> 55:07.679
‎Excuse me.

55:08.930 --> 55:09.764
‎Hey.

55:10.640 --> 55:12.392
‎Excuse me. Hey.

55:13.685 --> 55:14.644
‎Excuse me!

55:15.353 --> 55:17.147
‎-Sir, I'm sorry.
‎-What the hell?

55:17.230 --> 55:18.690
‎I'm really sorry.

55:20.150 --> 55:21.943
‎What's the matter with you?

55:22.027 --> 55:23.820
‎Is anyone there?

55:23.903 --> 55:25.572
‎Someone's dying in here!

55:25.655 --> 55:26.573
‎He's dying!

55:26.656 --> 55:28.241
‎What's wrong?

55:28.324 --> 55:29.325
‎Hurry!

55:29.409 --> 55:31.077
‎He can't breathe!

55:31.161 --> 55:32.620
‎He can't breathe. Keep still.

55:32.704 --> 55:34.706
‎CPR! Stay still!

55:34.789 --> 55:36.166
‎Stay put! Hurry!

55:36.958 --> 55:38.835
‎Please hurry!

55:38.918 --> 55:40.920
‎Oh my goodness!

55:41.004 --> 55:42.422
‎What's the matter with you?

55:43.173 --> 55:44.632
‎Just wait here for a bit!

55:47.761 --> 55:48.595
‎Open this right now!

55:48.678 --> 55:50.889
‎I'm really sorry. I'll be right back.

55:50.972 --> 55:52.140
‎What?

55:52.223 --> 55:55.101
‎Hey!

55:55.685 --> 55:58.563
‎Come on, I'm getting tired!

55:58.646 --> 56:00.523
‎Just die!

56:00.607 --> 56:02.400
‎Hey, that's enough!

56:03.610 --> 56:04.944
‎You might kill him.

56:05.028 --> 56:06.946
‎Come on, sir.

56:08.281 --> 56:11.076
‎Our construction project
‎is about to fall through because of you.

56:11.159 --> 56:13.745
‎We gave you plenty of chances to leave.

56:13.828 --> 56:15.580
‎I'll… I'll move out.

56:17.540 --> 56:18.416
‎Let's get ready.

56:19.250 --> 56:22.212
‎Are you saying you killed this student?

56:22.962 --> 56:25.340
‎Tell me.
‎You can take care of the body, right?

56:26.758 --> 56:29.385
‎You're scaring me.
‎Why are you asking me this?

56:30.053 --> 56:31.596
‎Money isn't a problem.

56:31.679 --> 56:33.181
‎I'll give you as much as you want.

56:33.264 --> 56:35.767
‎No, forget it!
‎I'll pretend I didn't hear that.

56:35.850 --> 56:37.060
‎Go away!

56:38.895 --> 56:42.690
‎Wow, this editing is incredible.

56:44.067 --> 56:45.944
‎I'm not a bad actor.

56:47.403 --> 56:50.031
‎Maybe I should go into acting.

56:51.116 --> 56:53.368
‎Boss, I got his signature.

56:55.870 --> 56:57.705
‎I'm tired of this line of work.

56:58.915 --> 57:01.417
‎I need to quit and retire.

57:02.335 --> 57:03.169
‎Don't you agree?

57:11.427 --> 57:13.429
‎Where did you get the gun?

57:13.513 --> 57:16.516
‎EVIDENCE ITEM NO. 9
‎EVIDENCE ITEM NO. 10: MOBILE PHONE

57:17.934 --> 57:19.519
‎-Goodbye, sir.
‎-Good work today.

57:19.602 --> 57:22.564
‎INTERROGATION ROOM

57:27.235 --> 57:28.278
‎Is he still refusing to talk?

57:29.070 --> 57:31.781
‎Yes, sir. Not a single word.

57:34.284 --> 57:36.744
‎Hey, mister. Your hearing is fine, right?

57:36.828 --> 57:40.331
‎You think cops are going to be nice
‎just because the world's a better place?

57:41.124 --> 57:42.375
‎What's your name?

57:43.334 --> 57:45.670
‎-Don't you know your own name?
‎-Look!

57:45.753 --> 57:48.047
‎This has been going on all night!

57:48.131 --> 57:49.549
‎-If you refuse to--
‎-Forget it.

57:49.632 --> 57:50.842
‎Just get his prints and check.

57:50.925 --> 57:52.051
‎Look him up in the system.

57:52.760 --> 57:53.678
‎Okay, sir.

57:57.056 --> 57:57.891
‎Your prints, please.

58:14.616 --> 58:16.576
‎-Open the trunk.
‎-Yes, sir.

58:23.041 --> 58:24.542
‎Damn it, it smells like blood.

58:25.960 --> 58:28.046
‎It's a dead body!

58:29.088 --> 58:31.841
‎You should've at least
‎covered it with plastic, idiot!

58:31.925 --> 58:33.134
‎-I'm sorry, sir!
‎-Hey, kid.

58:33.218 --> 58:34.052
‎Bring a sack.

58:34.135 --> 58:35.386
‎You idiot.

58:36.387 --> 58:37.514
‎Are you dodging?

58:40.850 --> 58:41.935
‎Oh, yeah?

58:57.158 --> 59:02.372
‎REQUESTING FINGERPRINT CHECK

59:07.252 --> 59:10.672
‎There are always people
‎who make you go through so much trouble.

59:10.755 --> 59:13.883
‎Back in my day,
‎we'd take people like him and just…

59:13.967 --> 59:15.260
‎For goodness' sake.

59:15.343 --> 59:16.386
‎Wait, what?

59:17.554 --> 59:19.222
‎-Captain.
‎-What is it?

59:19.305 --> 59:20.306
‎ACCESS APPROVAL CODE REQUIRED

59:20.390 --> 59:21.516
‎"Access denied"?

59:23.017 --> 59:24.602
‎I'll try it again.

59:33.444 --> 59:34.779
‎Does that belong to him?

59:34.862 --> 59:36.447
‎Yes, sir. We confiscated it.

59:46.124 --> 59:47.250
‎"My daughter"?

01:00:08.396 --> 01:00:09.397
‎What the hell?

01:00:23.202 --> 01:00:24.120
‎Hello?

01:00:31.210 --> 01:00:32.086
‎Is that you, Min-ji?

01:01:14.170 --> 01:01:17.799
‎AGENT KIM REACTIVATED

01:01:18.675 --> 01:01:19.592
‎Min-ji…

01:01:20.593 --> 01:01:23.596
‎I'm sorry for bringing you into this.

01:01:25.348 --> 01:01:27.558
‎Some guy from the North came to kill you.

01:01:27.642 --> 01:01:29.018
‎Rock and roll!

01:01:30.645 --> 01:01:31.646
‎Min-ji will be in danger too.

01:01:31.729 --> 01:01:32.605
‎Hurry up.

01:01:32.689 --> 01:01:33.773
‎Let's go find Min-ji.

01:01:34.691 --> 01:01:35.900
‎Get rid of any evidence first.

01:01:37.860 --> 01:01:40.905
‎Kim is out of his mind right now,
‎looking for his daughter.

01:01:41.823 --> 01:01:44.367
‎Where did you get that phone?

01:01:44.450 --> 01:01:45.993
‎It's the girl
‎I messed around with last night.

01:01:46.869 --> 01:01:48.371
‎Look for Kim's daughter right now.

01:01:48.454 --> 01:01:50.331
‎We need to take her hostage first.

01:01:50.832 --> 01:01:55.837
‎Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim
